<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3313] z.getInterpreterContext().out().clear() fails to clear table data</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3313</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3284&quot; title=&quot;z.getInterpreterContext().out().clear() broken in Python interpreter&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-3284&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-3284&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; fix the issue for plain text, but it still exist for table data. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; time
print(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;%table name\tage\njeff\t12&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
time.sleep(1)  
z.getInterpreterContext().out().clear()
print(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;%table name\tage\andy\t22&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
