&lt;p&gt;    &amp;gt; @zjffdu the issue in the second screenshot will not occur when viz switching is enabled, I&apos;m working on it&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Patch will be send in a different PR.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
